<title>GERMANY: Buba 6-mo rates for M3, cap formation, lending.</title>
<headline>Buba 6-mo rates for M3, cap formation, lending.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank on Thursday gave the following annualised growth rates for the six months to December for M3 money supply, money capital formation and bank lending. (in percent)</p>
<p>					 Dec		   Nov</p>
<p>    M3 growth			5.9		   5.5</p>
<p>    Money capital formation    4.9		   5.2</p>
<p>Bank lending to companies</p>
<p>    and private individuals    7.7		   5.8</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
